
### 1. Create an organization
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Switchly Demo"
}

### 2. Create a project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "77680c76-c076-4c13-a394-e7c152876486",
  "name": "My First Project"
}

### 3. Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 4. Update a project
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/cba03587-14f0-47b1-8be3-6a218fbc7a33
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "77680c76-c076-4c13-a394-e7c152876486",
  "name": "Switchly Updated Project"
}

### 5. Delete a project
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/cba03587-14f0-47b1-8be3-6a218fbc7a33
